flowchart TB
  F{First failed boundary}
  F -->|preflight / migration| DB[Stop; keep old compatible release; no Down]
  F -->|Worker V2 not Ready| W[Block API V2 producer]
  F -->|API rolling failure| A[Keep healthy old API replicas]
  F -->|V2 event already produced| V[Retain V2 Worker until backlog/replay zero]
  F -->|transport / storage| B[Retry + scoped backpressure; preserve Outbox]
  F -->|single Worker crash| L[Lease or Hangfire takeover]
  F -->|shutdown timeout| X[Force exit after grace; recover durable state]
  DB --> VERIFY[Fresh validation and immutable evidence]
  W --> VERIFY
  A --> VERIFY
  V --> VERIFY
  B --> VERIFY
  L --> VERIFY
  X --> VERIFY
